[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:A Polite Request]
[00:14.07]What was the polite request?
[00:19.46]If you park your car in the wrong place,
[00:23.61]a traffic policeman will soon find it.
[00:28.20]You will be very lucky
[00:30.59]if he lets you go without a ticket.
[00:34.71]However, this does not always happen.
[00:39.64]Traffic police are sometimes very polite.
[00:44.94]During a holiday in Sweden,
[00:48.14]I found this note on my car:
[00:53.06]'sir, we welcome you to our city.
[00:58.57]This is a No Parking area.
[01:02.86]You will enjoy your stay here
[01:05.36]if you pay attention to our street signs.
[01:09.84]This note is only a reminder.'
[01:14.46]If you receive a request like this,
[01:17.50]you cannot fail to obey it!
